messages.content:
{
  "message": "Fantastic—glad to hear you’re back at Excellent speed! Here’s what fixed it and why: • Enabling Data Roaming on the phone allowed data use on the French network. • Turning Data Saver OFF removed app/background restrictions that can break or slow data. • The short Airplane Mode toggle forced a fresh registration with the roaming network.

Tips to keep speeds excellent while abroad: • Keep Data Roaming ON and Data Saver OFF while you need full performance. • Leave Network Mode on 4G/5G preferred. • If speeds ever dip, try the 10‑second Airplane Mode toggle again. If still slow, we can reset APN settings and reboot as a next step.

FYI on your plan: you’ve used about 8.7 GB of your 15 GB allowance this cycle (resets 2025‑02‑28). If you need more later this trip, we can refuel up to 2 GB at $2/GB—just tell me how many GB you want.

Anything else I can help you with while you’re traveling?"
}

