      "what_to_do": "Use reseat_sim_card(): power off, remove the SIM tray, reinsert the SIM firmly, then power back on. After boot, wait 1–2 minutes and check for signal bars.",
      "why": "Even with SIM status Active, poor contact can still prevent registration."
    },
    {
      "step": "Reset APN to defaults, then reboot",
      "what_to_do": "Run check_apn_settings(). If anything looks incorrect or unknown, use reset_apn_settings(), then run reboot_device(). After the reboot, wait ~1 minute for registration.",
