    "If you still see no bars after turning Airplane Mode OFF: Go to Settings > Connections > SIM manager and make sure your SIM/eSIM for this line is turned ON. Then go to Settings > Connections > Mobile networks > Network mode and select 5G/LTE/3G/2G (auto connect)."
