      "step": "Reseat the SIM (if still failing)",
      "how": "Power off the phone. Remove the SIM, wait 10 seconds, reinsert carefully, power back on. Wait ~1 minute for the network to register (you should see 4G/5G).",
      "then": "Retry sending the small MMS to yourself."
