        "After resetting APN, restart the phone (full reboot) so the new settings apply."
      ],
      "notes": [
        "On many phones: Settings > Network & Internet/Cellular > SIM/Carrier > Access Point Names > Menu > Reset to default.",
        "A reboot after APN reset is required."
      ]
