  "thought_process": "MMS needs a working SIM (so the phone can attach to a network) and mobile data. Until the SIM is detected, the phone won’t get signal and cannot use data. Reseating the SIM fixes most recognition issues.",
  "what_to_do_now": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "title": "Reseat the SIM (quick software step)",
      "action_on_phone": "reseat_sim_card",
      "how": "On your phone, run the reseat_sim_card action (this simulates removing/reinserting the SIM).",
      "then": "After it completes, run check_sim_status again and tell me what it shows."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "title": "If it still says Missing, do a physical reseat",
      "how_generic": [
        "Power the phone OFF.",
        "Use the SIM eject tool (or a small paperclip) to open the SIM tray.",
        "Remove the SIM, check for dust/debris, and reinsert it carefully in the correct orientation so it sits flat.",
        "Reinsert the tray fully and power the phone ON."
      ],
      "after": [
        "Run check_sim_status again.",
        "If it asks for a SIM PIN and you know it, enter it. If you’re unsure, stop and tell me (don’t guess)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "title": "If still Missing after reseat, reboot",
      "how": "Run reboot_device, let it come fully back up, then run check_sim_status again."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "title": "If SIM shows Active",
      "do_next": [
        "Confirm Mobile Data is ON and Data Roaming is ON.",
        "Keep Wi‑Fi OFF for the test.",
        "Run check_network_status to verify you see bars and a network type (4G/LTE/5G).",
        "Open a simple website to confirm data works, then try resending your picture (MMS)."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "These steps won’t delete anything on your phone.",
    "If after physical reseat and reboot the SIM still shows Missing, the SIM or SIM reader may have a hardware issue. We’ll discuss next options if that happens (e.g., alternate SIM/eSIM options)."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Are you on iPhone or Android? I can give button-by-button instructions for the physical reseat.",
    "Please run reseat_sim_card now and tell me what check_sim_status shows afterward (Active, Missing, or Locked)."
  ]
}

